        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Event boundary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A successful CTrade call is a request, not proof of fill or close. MT5/broker controls placement, partial fills, execution and event delivery. EA tracking ends when a recognized exit transaction is processed; source does not distinguish partial exits before deactivation." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;spacing=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="180" y="610" width="730" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
